  message: "Owner ruled shape C in session 2026-09-19 and moved the row to todo_soft. The ruling, the rejected alternatives and the implementation shape are now on the description; ADR-0057 section 15 carries the rule text. Two sub-decisions taken under the ruling rather than escalated: one callee-name reader with the chain meta -> dst_ref.name -> symbol_name_slot (filed and fixed as INV-difud, which now blocks this row), and NO config key for section 15, on the grounds that a switch able to turn a definition off is a second definition. Open question 4 on the ADR — whether a linker-resolved edge may supersede under section 14 — is adjacent and deliberately NOT folded in here."  # 4c4a
